OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on Rosebank
OL,4,Aoil field and long-term policy plans at
OL,5,APMQs
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch presses Andy Burnham on
OL,8,Fthe Rosebank oil field and his
OL,9,Flong-term plans for the country at
OL,10,FPrime Minister's Questions
OL,12,FThe Conservative leader asks why
OL,13,FRosebank has not been approved yet -
OL,14,FBurnham says a decision on the site in
OL,15,Fthe North Sea will be taken "in due
OL,16,Fcourse"
OL,18,FShe also asks the prime minister about
OL,19,Fhis long-term spending plans - and
OL,20,Faccuses the government of being
OL,21,F"adrift"
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
