OL,3,ABadenoch presses Burnham on Rosebank
OL,4,Aoil field and long-term policy plans at
OL,5,APMQs
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham promises to present his
OL,8,Flong-term "plan for Britain" before
OL,9,FChristmas - but does not put a date on
OL,10,Fthe Spending Review, which sets out
OL,11,Ffuture government budgets
OL,13,FIt was their first Commons showdown
OL,14,Fsince the Budget, as their deputies
OL,15,Ftook questions last week
